% hyph_de_TEST.dic -- a tiny hyphenation dictionary written for spelltest (not a real
% language's patterns): two levels as libhyphen's de_DE, ISO8859-1 like it
LEFTHYPHENMIN 2
RIGHTHYPHENMIN 2
COMPOUNDLEFTHYPHENMIN 2
COMPOUNDRIGHTHYPHENMIN 2
# first level: the parts of compound words (an odd digit after a part)
